<title>UK: Wet Brent trades 8 cents weaker at July -70 cents.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades 8 cents weaker at July -70 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Dated Brent cargo loading June 17-19 traded at July Brent -70 cents on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The trade was done eight cents lower than a cargo of same loading dates traded on Monday and 21 cents lower than a June 16-18 cargo bought last Friday.</p>
<p>- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
